<body>
    <h1>Replicating a Logic+ Flow</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"ReplicatingaLogic+Flow-Overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Duplicating a Logic+ flow is a straightforward process that involves cop=
ying and pasting the JSON body of the existing flow. If you already have th=
e JSON, you can proceed directly to the creation steps. Otherwise, you can =
retrieve the JSON from the Logic+ user interface.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"ReplicatingaLogic+Flow-Prerequisites"><strong>Prerequisites</stro=
ng></h3>
<p>Before proceeding, ensure you have the following:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Administrator access to Sharpen</p></li>
<li>
<p>Logic+ enabled on your account</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"ReplicatingaLogic+Flow-StepstoDuplicateaLogic+Flow"><strong>Steps=
 to Duplicate a Logic+ Flow</strong></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Obtain the JSON Body</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If you already have the JSON copied, proceed to Step 4.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Otherwise, navigate to <strong>Admin =E2=86=92 Configuration =E2=86=92 L=
ogic+</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Locate the Logic+ flow you want to duplicate, hover over it, and click t=
o open.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Copy the JSON Body</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Once the page loads, locate the top-right corner of the interface.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Click <code>{}</code><strong> JSON</strong> to access the JSON body.</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Highlight and copy the entire JSON structure displayed.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Create a New Logic+ Flow</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Return to the <strong>Logic+ main page</strong> by navigating to <strong=
>Admin =E2=86=92 Configuration =E2=86=92 Logic+</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>"New Logic+"</strong> to start creating a new flow.</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Configure the New Logic+ Flow</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assign a <strong>Name</strong> and provide a <strong>Brief Description</=
strong> outlining the purpose of the flow.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Paste the JSON Body</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>In the new Logic+ flow, click <code>{}</code><strong> JSON</strong> in t=
he top-right corner.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Paste the copied JSON body into the provided field.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Save the New Flow</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Save</strong> as New Draft to finalize the duplication pro=
cess.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Publish the flow once it is ready for deployment.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"2025-01-29_13-17-07.gif" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" s=
rc=3D"46f793c8aa1c65967bd6e85eb5184ac2693fa64d4475613a9371ecff262ca495" dat=
a-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/44=
47010817/2025-01-29_13-17-07.gif?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1738181=
881122&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"676" data-width=3D=
"1368" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"44463=
22711" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"atta=
chment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"2025-01-29_13-17-07.gif" data=
-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-con=
tent-type=3D"image/gif" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4447010817" da=
ta-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2" data-media-id=3D"de4650b2-6681-4=
67c-a7ab-3bba3346f02f" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"231"></span>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"ReplicatingaLogic+Flow-Conclusion"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h=
3>
<p>You have now successfully duplicated a Logic+ flow. The newly created fl=
ow will mirror the original configuration, ensuring consistency and efficie=
ncy in your Logic+ setup.</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
